---
title: Incident handoff
description: Transfer incident status, evidence, and outstanding actions between responders.
schema:
  Event:
    time: string
    summary: string
    evidence: string[]
  Action:
    task: string
    owner: string
  Incident:
    id: string
    service: string
    status: "'investigating' | 'resolved'"
    impact: string
    timeline: Event[]
    actions: Action[]
    restoredAt: ["string | null", "@", { default: null }]
input: Incident
---
# {id}: {service}

**Status:** {status}

## Customer impact

{impact}

## Timeline

<$each items={timeline} as="event">
  - **{event.time}** — {event.summary}
    <$each items={event.evidence} as="evidence">
      - {evidence}
    </$each>
</$each>

<$show if={status === "resolved"}>
  ## Recovery

  Service was restored at {restoredAt}. Follow-up actions remain assigned below.

</$show>
<$show if={status === "investigating"}>
  ## Current handoff

  The cause is not confirmed. Continue from the recorded evidence and report
  new findings before changing the recovery plan.

</$show>
## Assigned actions

<$each items={actions} as="action">
  - [ ] **{action.owner}:** {action.task}
</$each>
